sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant A as Agent

    Note over User,A: LEAN MODE (Simple complexity, Low/Medium risk)

    User->>O: Task request
    O->>O: Classify: Lean
    O->>A: implementing-feature (Balanced)
    A->>A: Deterministic gates (format, build, lint, typecheck, tests, style greps)
    A-->>O: Completion report
    O->>O: Update progress.md
    O-->>User: Report + AI Execution Metrics

    Note over User,A: STANDARD MODE (Standard complexity, Low/Medium risk)

    User->>O: Task request
    O->>O: Classify: Standard
    O->>A: Consolidated discovery-and-planning (Balanced)
    Note right of A: Stage 1: Research
    Note right of A: Stage 2: Architecture assessment
    Note right of A: Stage 3: Planning
    A->>A: Write research.md
    A->>A: Write system-design-analysis.md (if needed)
    A->>A: Write implementation-plan.md
    A->>A: Write context-capsule.md
    A-->>O: Plan artifacts + capsule
    O->>User: Approve implementation plan?
    User-->>O: Approved
    O->>A: implementing-feature (Balanced)
    A->>A: Production code + style gate
    A-->>O: Completion report
    O->>A: testing-implementation (Balanced)
    A->>A: Tests + lint
    A-->>O: Completion report
    O->>O: Run Completion Gate (format, compile, lint, typecheck, tests, style greps, API check, package check)
    O->>A: Combined Output Judge + semantic review (Balanced, cross-vendor)
    Note right of A: AC coverage if requirements.md exists
    Note right of A: Scope, architecture, regressions, errors, concurrency, test quality
    A-->>O: PASS / FAIL
    O->>O: Update progress.md
    O-->>User: Report + AI Execution Metrics

    Note over User,A: HIGH ASSURANCE MODE (High/Critical risk)

    User->>O: Task request
    O->>O: Classify: High Assurance
    O->>A: researching-codebase (Complex)
    A-->>O: research.md
    O->>A: analyzing-system-design (Complex, mandatory)
    A-->>O: system-design-analysis.md
    O->>A: planning-implementation (Complex)
    A-->>O: implementation-plan.md
    O->>A: Critique gate (Expert Review, cross-vendor)
    A-->>O: APPROVED
    O->>User: Approve implementation plan?
    User-->>O: Approved
    O->>A: implementing-feature (Balanced or Complex)
    A->>A: Production code + style gate
    A-->>O: Completion report
    O->>A: testing-implementation (Balanced or Complex)
    A->>A: Tests + lint
    A-->>O: Completion report
    O->>O: Run Completion Gate
    O->>A: Output Judge (Expert Review, cross-vendor)
    A-->>O: PASS / FAIL
    O->>A: Semantic review (Expert Review, cross-vendor)
    A-->>O: PASS / FAIL
    O->>O: Update progress.md
    O-->>User: Report + AI Execution Metrics
